{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9CcmF6aWxpYW4tTW92aWVzL1RoZSUyMFNlY29uZCUyME1vdGhlciUyMCUyODIwMTUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Second Mother","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/u1tDQun2iJAzersd94S8P47WEOL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9h5BsxRmxLAvASADo2VcTlTUdb0.jpg","description":"After leaving her daughter Jessica in a small town in Pernambuco to be raised by relatives, Val spends the next 13 years working as a nanny to Fabinho in São Paulo. She has financial stability but has to live with the guilt of having not raised Jessica herself. As Fabinho’s university entrance exams approach, Jessica reappears in her life and seems to want to give her mother a second chance. However, Jessica has not been raised to be a servant and her very existence will turn Val’s routine on its head. With precision and humour, the subtle and powerful forces that keep rigid class structures in place and how the youth may just be the ones to shake it all up.\n\nReleased 4 Jun 2015 · Brazil · Language: Portuguese · 112 min\nStudio: África Filmes, Gullane Entretenimento, Globo Filmes\n\nOn your server — Audio: Portuguese","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"8.0","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Regina Casé","Camila Márdila","Karine Teles","Lourenço Mutarelli","Michel Joelsas","Helena Albergaria","Bete Dorgam","Luis Miranda"],"director":["Anna Muylaert"],"released":"2015-06-04T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anna Muylaert","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8oPBKPmVhZYZjUsj1rFO4BjNld6.jpg"},{"name":"Regina Casé","character":"Val","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rVtZBMj1N46vBxJ6e8HJ8CmsaAj.jpg"},{"name":"Camila Márdila","character":"Jéssica","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7VAteV7SQqiAaHcMb9ElikCiIZS.jpg"},{"name":"Karine Teles","character":"Bárbara","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tuefwgcWVmjlTs11mvRaxtyKiLp.jpg"}